<Base title="Privacy Policy — StructZero Platform" description="StructZero platform privacy policy and data governance practices.">
  <section class="py-20 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 prose prose-invert">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: July 28, 2026</p>

    <h2>Data Isolation & Security</h2>
    <p>StructZero builds run in isolated, sandboxed containers. Your code, AST project DNA, and conversation transcripts are never used for public model training.</p>

    <h2>Telemetry & Monitoring</h2>
    <p>Every model call and decision log remains under strict customer access controls.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
